  "question": {
    "text": "If $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 1\\end{array}\\right]$ and $B=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 7 & -2 & 1\\end{array}\\right]$ then $A B$ equals"
