    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}\n1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n2 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n-3 & 2 & 1\n\\end{array}\\right], B=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}\n1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n-2 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n7 & -2 & 1\n\\end{array}\\right] \\\\\n& A B=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}\n1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n0 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n0 & 0 & 1\n\\end{array}\\right]=I\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
